  "steps": [
    "Seoul Gochujang × Ghee Roast, with Curry Leaves, Cashews & Chilli Oil.",
    "Cook It: Grill, air-fry, pan-sear or add to a coconut-based gravy.",
    "Gochujang Ghee Roast Rice Bowl — Sesame rice, grilled paneer, smashed cucumber, pickled carrots and spring onions.",
    "Ghee Roast Roomali Wrap — Roomali roti filled with paneer, cabbage slaw, pickled onions and lime yoghurt.",
    "Bombay Pineapple Chaat × BBQ, with Charred Pineapple & Red Onion.",
    "Cook It: Grill, air-fry or pan-sear over moderate heat.",
    "BBQ Paneer Burrito — Paneer, coriander rice, black beans, sautéed peppers, lettuce and sour cream in a toasted tortilla.",
    "Chaat BBQ Paneer Skewers — Paneer skewered with capsicum and onion, grilled and served with mint yoghurt.",
    "Chole Caesar × Kolkata Kasundi, with Crispy Chickpeas & Cracked Pepper.",
    "Cook It: Pan-sear, grill or air-fry until lightly golden.",
    "Paneer Caesar Crunch Salad — Romaine, cucumber, crispy chickpeas and grilled paneer with Caesar dressing and crushed croutons.",
    "Kasundi Paneer Baguette — A crusty baguette filled with sliced paneer, lettuce, tomato, cucumber, pickled beetroot and kasundi mayo.",
    "Salsa Verde × Amritsari Tikka, with Green Chilli & Toasted Pumpkin Seeds.",
    "Cook It: Grill, air-fry, pan-sear or crumble and sauté as keema.",
    "Green Tikka Paneer Quesadilla — Chopped paneer, sautéed onions and melting cheese in a crisp tortilla, served with lime yoghurt.",
    "Green Paneer Keema Pav — Crumbled paneer sautéed with onions and peppers, finished with salsa verde and stuffed into butter-toasted pav.",
    "Parisian French Onion × Kasundi, with Crispy Onions & Chives.",
    "Cook It: Pan-sear, grill, air-fry or add to a creamy mushroom gravy.",
    "French Onion Paneer Puff Pockets — Puff pastry filled with cooked paneer, sautéed spinach and cheese, baked until golden.",
    "Creamy Mustard Paneer & Mushroom Gravy — Paneer in a garlic-mushroom cream gravy with kasundi and black pepper, served with garlic toast."
